  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MAURITANIA IDF Strengthening the Public Procurement Function</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of the IDF Grant is (i) to respond to the Government.s request for financial and technical assistance to continue their reform of the Public Procurement System by improving its efficiency, quality and transparency, (ii) to strengthen its national institutional procurement management capacity, and (iii) to improve substantially the quality of procurement fiduciary management in Mauritania. Items (ii) and (iii) are part of the strategic elements of the CAS (May 2002), which requires that fiduciary issues be fully taken into account for a potential future Poverty Reduction Strategy Credit (PRSC)</narrative>
  </description>
